==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Rocky Helmet}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
*The [[Rocky Helmet]] is a [[held item]] introduced in {{game|Black and White|s}}. It damages an attacker who makes [[contact]] with the holder.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Rocky Helmet|193}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.

